][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]runtime-loaders: add a lightweight completion ensure fast path, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]runtime-aware grammar caches, and portable loaders for bash, fish, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]zsh, preserving the existing raw script generators and candidate fast [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]path.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Install, refresh, update, and diagnostic integration[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]install-update[dim] · [dim][/dim]after runtime-loaders[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]install-update: make stamped installs use the loaders, refresh both [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]local and chezmoi-owned installs, include successful update mode [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]switches, and distinguish loader registration from cached grammar [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]freshness in diagnostics.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Chezmoi migration and upgrade regression coverage[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]chezmoi-integration[dim] · [dim][/dim]after runtime-loaders, install-update[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chezmoi-integration: distribute portable loaders instead of frozen [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]grammar and runtime stamps, migrate the linked chezmoi configuration, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prove upgrade behavior through real shells and repeated applies, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]document the lifecycle.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-12o","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-12o.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-7c455de4fd035713ae1e59956320eb91","started_at":"2026-09-18T10:06:36.138831+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements"